<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/login.css">
    <title>study-tracker</title>
</head>
<style>
    .err {
        color: red;
    }
</style>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>study-tracker</h1>
        <form action="/" method="post">
            <p class="err">아이디 또는 비밀번호가 일치하지 않습니다.</p>
            <input type="id" name="id" placeholder="아이디" autocomplete="off"><br>
            <input type="password" name="pw" placeholder="비밀번호" autocomplete="off"><br>
            <button class="login_button">로그인</button>
        </form>
        <a href="/register"><p class="reg-text">회원이 아니신가요?</p></a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>